      "alt": "TQMaRZG2x",
      "text": "<h1>Based on RZ/G2 with enhanced performance and graphics properties</h1>\n<p>The TQMaRZG2x Embedded Module is a powerful solution for embedded computing engineers. It's based on the RZ/G2 processor from Renesas, featuring a combination of Cortex-A53 and Cortex-A57 cores. This module excels in performance and graphics capabilities, supporting 4K graphics with a quad-core setup. It boasts LPDDR4 with ECC support and enables high-speed communication through Gbit Ethernet, PCle, and USB 3.0 interfaces. Integrated security functions ensure data safety, making it an ideal choice for a wide range of applications.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 03:13:06 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
