     "table": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "text": "<table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><td><b>CPU</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>CPU/Processor:<ul>\n<li>Cortex®-A53 - Up to 1,2GHz</li>\n<li>Cortex®-A57 - Up to 1,5GHz</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>CPU variant:<ul>\n<li>RZ/G2M Quad A57 + Dual A53</li>\n<li>RZ/G2N Dual A57</li>\n<li>RZ/G2H Quad A53 + Quad A57</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Memory</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>LPDDR4: Up to 8 GB</li>\n<li>EEPROM: 0/64-kbit</li>\n<li>eMMC: Up to 64 GB</li>\n<li>Quad SPI NOR: Up to 256 MB</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Graphics</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Graphics: LCD Interface (1x HDMI 2.0, 1x LVDS, 1x Digital RGB)</li>\n<li>Camera: 2x MIPI CSI2</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Communications Interfaces</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Ethernet: 1x Ethernet 10/100/1000 Mbit</li>\n<li>CAN: Up to 2x CAN FD</li>\n<li>Serial Ports:<ul>\n<li>Up to 6x UART</li>\n<li>Up to 5x H-UART</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>USB:<ul>\n<li>Up to 1x USB 3.0 OTG interface</li>\n<li>2x USB 2.0 high-speed OTG interface</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Other Interfaces</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>SD Card: Up to 4x SDIO</li>\n<li>PCIe: Up to 2x PCIe 2.0</li>\n<li>I2C: Up to 7x I2C</li>\n<li>SPI:<ul>\n<li>Up to 4x SPI</li>\n<li>Up to 1x QSPI</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>I2S: Up to 10x I²S</li>\n<li>GPIO: Up to 32x GPIO</li>\n<li>SATA: Up to 1x SATA (only RZ/G2N)</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>General</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Temperature sensor</li>\n<li>Dimensions: 77 mm x 50 mm</li>\n<li>Temperature range:<ul>\n<li>Standard temperature range: -25°C…+85°C</li>\n<li>Extended temperature: -40°C…+85°C</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Power supply: 5 V</li>\n<li>Plug-in System: Board-to-board plug-in system 440 pins 0.5 mm Pitch (TBD)</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>OS</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Linux</li>\n<li>QNX on request</li>\n<li>Android on request</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 03:13:20 GMT+0000",
